px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#9aa4a8] hover:text-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/now\">现在</a></nav></header><div class=\"relative z-10\"><main id=\"cstd-main\"><header data-cstd-page-hero=\"true\" class=\"relative flex overflow-hidden border-b border-white/15 min-h-[68svh]\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-topic-evidence-first-ai\"><img data-cstd-page-hero-image=\"true\" alt=\"证据胶囊与验证核心\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:58% 50%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-universe/cstd-evidence-foundry-v2.webp\"/><div data-cstd-page-hero-overlay=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.96)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.78)_46%,rgba(5,7,9,0.18)_100%)]\"></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-grid=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 [background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.09)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.09)_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:64px_64px]\"></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-material=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\"></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-artifacts=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden\"><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"neon\" class=\"cstd-deep-neon-rig\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-index\">CSTD / 轨迹 09</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-coordinate\">-33.8688 / 151.2093</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-signal\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-lock\">信号已锁定</span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"underworld\" class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-stele\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-kicker\">冥府档案 / 工坊 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-seal\"><i></i><i></i><b>V</b></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-oath\">经试炼，方可归返</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-cuts\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"astral\" class=\"cstd-deep-astral-compass\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-kicker\">星界旅记 / 判定 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-die\"><i></i><b>20</b><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-route\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-oath\">选择落笔，旅程成章</span></div></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-content=\"true\" class=\"relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1540px] flex-col justify-end px-5 pb-16 pt-28 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:pb-20\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl\"><p data-cstd-page-hero-eyebrow=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">CURATED PATH / 02</p><h1 data-cstd-page-hero-title=\"true\" class=\"mt-6 text-balance text-[2.375rem] font-semibold leading-[0.94] tracking-[0] text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl md:leading-[0.9] lg:text-8xl xl:text-[7rem]\">证据优先 AI</h1><p data-cstd-page-hero-summary=\"true\" class=\"mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#c3c9cb] md:text-xl md:leading-9\">模型负责综合，证据、版本与确定性核心负责约束。</p></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-scroll=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#748187]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down h-3.5 w-3.5 animate-bounce text-[#f4d431]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg> <!-- -->向下滚动 / 继续查看</div></div></header><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#f1eee5] px-5 py-14 text-[#090b0d] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1320px] gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[14rem_minmax(0,1fr)]\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-fit items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#0b6473] hover:text-black\" href=\"/topics\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg> <!-- -->全部主题</a><p class=\"max-w-4xl text-2xl font-semibold leading-10 md:text-4xl md:leading-tight\">把研究 Agent、异步任务、引用和过期写保护连成一条可审计路径。</p></div></section><nav data-cstd-topic-path=\"true\" aria-label=\"连续判断路径\" class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#07090b] px-5 py-7 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#718087]\"><span>连续判断路径</span><span>02<!-- --> / <!-- -->05</span></div><ol class=\"mt-4 grid gap-1 sm:grid-cols-5\"><li><a class=\"group block border-t border-white/15 pt-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#6f7b80] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white aria-[current=step]:border-[#f4d431] aria-[current=step]:text-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/topics/system-boundaries\"><span class=\"mr-2\">01</span>系统边界与运行所有权</a></li><li><a aria-current=\"step\" class=\"group block border-t border-white/15 pt-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#6f7b80] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white aria-[current=step]:border-[#f4d431] aria-[current=step]:text-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/topics/evidence-first-ai\"><span class=\"mr-2\">02</span>证据优先 AI</a></li><li><a class=\"group block border-t border-white/15 pt-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#6f7b80] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white aria-[current=step]:border-[#f4d431] aria-[current=step]:text-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/topics/quantitative-systems\"><span class=\"mr-2\">03</span>定量研究系统</a></li><li><a class=\"group block border-t border-white/15 pt-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#6f7b80] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white aria-[current=step]:border-[#f4d431] aria-[current=step]:text-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/topics/visual-computing\"><span class=\"mr-2\">04</span>浏览器视觉计算</a></li><li><a class=\"group block border-t border-white/15 pt-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#6f7b80] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white aria-[current=step]:border-[#f4d431] aria-[current=step]:text-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/topics/interdisciplinary-engineering\"><span class=\"mr-2\">05</span>跨学科工程路径</a></li></ol></div></nav><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#080a0c] px-5 py-16 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase\" style=\"color:#ff5a50\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg> <!-- -->真实系统</h2><div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-white/15\"><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/work/alpha-research-system\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">证据管线 / 决策工作台</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">CSTD Alpha 研究系统</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">把“问一句出一篇报告”拆成可回看的研究流程：来源、异步任务、估值版本和反证条件都跟着结果保存。</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">打开证据<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/work/creative-workbench\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">生成式媒体 / 私有工作流</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">CSTD Design 创作工作台</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">一个给自己使用的中文创作工作台：对话可以分支，图片和视频任务可以恢复，素材始终找得到来源。</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">打开证据<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#080a0c] px-5 py-16 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase\" style=\"color:#24e0ff\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg> <!-- -->工程札记</h2><div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-white/15\"><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/notes/evidence-first-ai-research\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">AI 系统 / 13 MIN</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">先刷新证据，再让模型说话</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">公司研究最贵的往往不是 token，而是过期事实、重复任务和说不清来路的结论。</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">打开证据<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/notes/deterministic-core-ai-edge\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">产品工程 / 12 MIN</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">AI 放在解释层，公式留在决策层</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">让 AI 帮忙整理和解释，但把估值公式、现金流、折现和版本决定权留给能测试的代码。</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">打开证据<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#080a0c] px-5 py-16 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase\" style=\"color:#3dff8f\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg> <!-- -->可运行实验</h2><div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-white/15\"><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/lab/agent-replay\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">LAB 02 / 1.1.0</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">Agent Replay</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">过期任务可以完成，但不能覆盖当前事实。</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">打开证据<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/lab/proof-museum\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">LAB 05 / 1.0.0</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">Proof Museum</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">展示工程能力最好的方式，是让关键边界可以被重新运行。</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">打开证据<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><a class=\"group relative block min-h-[28rem] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/12 px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431] md:px-10 lg:px-16\" href=\"/topics/quantitative-systems\"><img alt=\"安静知识档案中的连续阅读路径\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-[44%_50%] opacity-55 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.025]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-universe/cstd-quiet-archive-v4.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90de